      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدَمِىٌّ</span></b>  <i>A seller of</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدَم</span>, or] <i>skins,</i> or <i>hides:</i>
(TA:) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَدَّامٌ</span></b>  signifies the same; and particularly <i>a seller of goats' skins.</i> (Golius, from
the larger work entitled Mirkát el-Loghah.)

